{"id":30135,"artist":"Billy Joel","title":"Just the Way You Are","lyrics_plain":"Don't go changing, to try and please me\nYou never let me down before, mmmm\nDon't imagine, you're too familiar\nAnd I don't see you anymore\nI would not leave you in times of trouble\nWe never could have come this far, mmmm\nI took the good times, I'll take the bad times\nI'll take you just the way you are\nDon't go trying, some new fashion\nDon't change the color of your hair, mmmm\nYou always have my, unspoken passion\nAlthough I might not seem to care\nI don't want clever conversation\nI never want to work that hard, mmmm\nI just want someone, that I can talk to\nI want you just the way you are\nI need to know that you will always be\nThe same old someone that I knew\nMmmm, what will it take till you believe in me\nThe way that I believe in you\nI said I love you, and that's forever\nAnd this I promise from the heart, mmmm\nI could not love you any better\nI love you just the way you are (.....sax.solo.....)\nI don't want clever conversation\nI never want to work that hard, mmmm\nI just want someone, that I can talk to\nI want you just the way you are (.....sax.solo..till.fade.....)","lyrics_synced":"[00:11.52] Don't go changing, to try and please me\n[00:18.38] You never let me down before, mmmm\n[00:25.76] Don't imagine, you're too familiar\n[00:32.61] And I don't see you anymore\n[00:38.65] I would not leave you in times of trouble\n[00:46.87] We never could have come this far, mmmm\n[00:53.99] I took the good times, I'll take the bad times\n[01:01.11] I'll take you just the way you are\n[01:11.98] Don't go trying, some new fashion\n[01:18.90] Don't change the color of your hair, mmmm\n[01:25.96] You always have my, unspoken passion\n[01:33.12] Although I might not seem to care\n[01:38.40] I don't want clever conversation\n[01:47.28] I never want to work that hard, mmmm\n[01:54.41] I just want someone, that I can talk to\n[02:01.50] I want you just the way you are\n[02:12.22] I n